  <TM_MinionR.label>仆从</TM_MinionR.label>
  <!--原中文: '仆从是一群顽皮，懒惰且残忍的懦夫，它们来自一个悲惨的位面。他们看上去就像是长着一双眼睛的漂浮肉球。它们拥有又短又小的胳膊， 嘴上永远挂着险恶的微笑， 它们有两到三只角.\n他们可以一直漂浮着的原因并不被人所知， 但人们只能猜错这与他们所到之处带来的强烈的，腐烂气息有一些关系.\n它们的实用性有待商榷; 他们掌握一点战斗的技巧但会在战斗一段时间后逃跑。他们可以做一些简单的工作比如搬运和清洁(虽然他们对于“清洁”的含义有一些误解)。然而， 它们看上去更喜欢叼着烟在电视附近闲逛而不是从事任何生产工作.\n他们可以通过诱骗轻易地召唤过来... 额， 训练过的魔法师， 作为回报，偶尔需要从它们的“恶魔老板”手中给它们一些休息时间， 它们就会更愿意帮助这个地方“解决问题”.\n偶尔， 它们会表现出去撞击物体的渴望，这时候可以(通常)被说服去击碎附近的石头.\n如果任务对于它们太难了或者它们感到厌烦了， 它们就会逃回到它们来的地方。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Minions are mischievous, lazy, cruel cowards that come from a miserable plane of existence.  They appear as a floating meatball with a giant eye.  They have stubby, little arms a mouth that seems transfixed in a nasty smile, and two or three horns.
It's not clear how they float, though one can only assume it has something to do with the hot, putrid stench that follows them everywhere.
Their usefulness is open for debate; they possess little in terms of combat ability and would sooner flee than fight.  They -can- do simple tasks such as hauling and cleaning (though they seem to have a different definition of "clean").  However, it seems more likely to find them lounging near the television or smoking a joint (or both) than doing anything productive.
They can be summoned by gullible... er, trained mages, and, in return for giving them a break from their "pit fiend of a boss," they are willing to "help out" around the place.
Occasionally, they express the desire to hit things and can (usually) be convinced to hit some nearby rocks.
If things get too tough for them or they get bored, they'll flee back to wherever they came.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Minions are mischievous, lazy, cruel cowards that come from a miserable plane of existence.  They appear as a floating meatball with a giant eye.  They have stubby, little arms a mouth that seems transfixed in a nasty smile, and two or three horns.
It's not clear how they float, though one can only assume it has something to do with the hot, putrid stench that follows them everywhere.
Their usefulness is open for debate; they possess little in terms of combat ability and would sooner flee than fight.  They -can- do simple tasks such as hauling and cleaning (though they seem to have a different definition of "clean").  However, it seems more likely to find them lounging near the television or smoking a joint (or both) than doing anything productive.
They can be summoned by gullible... er, trained mages, and, in return for giving them a break from their "pit fiend of a boss," they are willing to "help out" around the place.
Occasionally, they express the desire to hit things and can (usually) be convinced to hit some nearby rocks.
If things get too tough for them or they get bored, they'll flee back to wherever they came.-->
  <TM_MinionR.description>仆从是一群顽皮，懒惰且残忍的懦夫，它们来自一个悲惨的位面。他们看上去就像是长着一双眼睛的漂浮肉球。它们拥有又短又小的胳膊， 嘴上永远挂着险恶的微笑， 它们有两到三只角.\n他们可以一直漂浮着的原因并不被人所知， 但人们只能猜错这与他们所到之处带来的强烈的，腐烂气息有一些关系.\n它们的实用性有待商榷; 他们掌握一点战斗的技巧但会在战斗一段时间后逃跑。他们可以做一些简单的工作比如搬运和清洁(虽然他们对于“清洁”的含义有一些误解)。然而， 它们看上去更喜欢叼着烟在电视附近闲逛而不是从事任何生产工作.\n他们可以通过诱骗轻易地召唤过来... 额， 训练过的魔法师， 作为回报，偶尔需要从它们的“恶魔老板”手中给它们一些休息时间， 它们就会更愿意帮助这个地方“解决问题”.\n偶尔， 它们会表现出去撞击物体的渴望，这时候可以(通常)被说服去击碎附近的石头.\n如果任务对于它们太难了或者它们感到厌烦了， 它们就会逃回到它们来的地方。</TM_MinionR.description>
